        <BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize">BQAAAAoAAABCbG9ja0FoZWFkAwEFAAAARGVidWcDAAsAAABGaW5lQnVuZGxlcwIGAAAAc3RlYWR5CAAAAE1hbmlmZXN0AgQAAABMZWFuDAAAAFNvdXJjZUZpbHRlcgMA</BinaryString>
        <SecurityCapabilities name="Capabilities">0</SecurityCapabilities>
        <ContentId name="LinkedSource">
